  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_3263.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En los campos de la Caja Rural de Onda se ha celebrado la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado un concurso social de silvestrismo, para todas las variedades de p&aacute;jaros, organizado por la Sociedad Ornitol&oacute;gica Sant&iacute;simo Salvador.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3234.jpg\" alt=\"img_3234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3235.jpg\" alt=\"img_3235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3236.jpg\" alt=\"img_3236\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3237.jpg\" alt=\"img_3237\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3240.jpg\" alt=\"img_3240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3241.jpg\" alt=\"img_3241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3242.jpg\" alt=\"img_3242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3243.jpg\" alt=\"img_3243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/silvestrismecampscaixarural110415/img_3246.jpg\" alt=\"img_3246\" style=\"max-widt